.TH OPENCOBOLIDE 1 "September 2026" "OpenCobolIDE 4.7.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
opencobolide \- launch the OpenCobolIDE COBOL development environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opencobolide
.RI [ files ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B OpenCobolIDE
is a graphical editor and development environment for COBOL programs using
the system-installed GnuCOBOL compiler.
.PP
This package is an unofficial compatibility polish of OpenCobolIDE 4.7.6 for
modern Python, PyQt5, and Debian-family Linux. It preserves the original
project ownership and was prepared with assistance from OpenAI Codex.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/OpenCobolIDE/
Per-user application settings.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cobc (1)
.SH AUTHORS
OpenCobolIDE was created and maintained by Colin Duquesnoy with contributions
from the OpenCobolIDE community.
